1412237_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JX1VxKzJpF8Q7kNvwFY24Vt&_nc_oc=AdqMa9t1EQ3K3qqxGIMeH0YhwOB0LofbvN1tjvdXy7N6o0czubI1crC6133xtNWM2Vg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQgygaFsp0Y2ylAZodd-_DElahZ3zHe00n287vFSt4L5A&oe=6B046EC5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Feather Dodge", "keywords": ["dodge", "birds", "angry", "fly", "horizon"], "long_description": "Take Flight and Dodge the Flock in the Ultimate VR Reflex Challenge!\n\nSpread your wings and prepare for a high-speed airborne adventure in Feather Dodge! In this vibrant, fast-paced VR arcade experience, you control a swift little bird soaring through a dense, beautiful pine forest. Your mission is simple but intense: survive the incoming rush of eccentric, colorful birds flying straight your way!\n\nThe sky gets crowded quickly as a massive variety of round, stylized feathered rivals zoom past. Use your VR controllers to seamlessly weave left, right, up, and down to avoid sudden mid-air collisions. As the timer ticks up, the speed increases and the patterns become trickier, pushing your hand-eye coordination and spatial awareness to the absolute limit.\n\nHow long can you rule the forest canopy before the chaos catches up to you?\n\nKey Features:\nIntuitive VR Controls: Seamlessly guide your bird's flight path using your VR controllers for sharp, precise, and responsive dodging mechanics.\n\nFast-Paced Arcade Thrills: Experience a continuous wave of unpredictable incoming traffic that tests your reaction speed with every second.\n\nVibrant Stylized Visuals: Fly through a beautifully animated 3D forest environment filled with lush greenery, towering trees, and a colorful cast of expressive avian characters.\n\nDynamic High-Score Tracking: Watch your survival time climb in real-time, push past your limits, and try to break your personal record on every run.", "short_description": "Take flight and test your reflexes! Navigate a swift bird through a dense, endless forest, dodging incoming waves of colorful feathered rivals in this fast-paced VR arcade challenge."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://nomanawan89.wixsite.com/brokenengineers", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Broken Engineers", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://nomanawan89.wixsite.com/brokenengineers", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1110109585524263"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823812_1027829079839965_7853190544050720203_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EBBRxQaxLQAQ7kNvwFXYiuN&_nc_oc=AdqgGLEQlpnCE5GHdcdzi4zdYk_Aq3sjg9UyZ4-Ysl_v98Y4RMki4-nsvb1tiIRA6GI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTGCk2cefBIFSOTV7deX2eXYlvxYE-twQlHh9S9xWzokA&oe=6B04887B"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Feather Dodge", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Action", "id": "459781504968480"}, {"topic_na